{"t":"Vampire Hunter Quest","s":"vampire-hunter-quest-65472","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Merge_arrows_9df07b.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Merge-arrows\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Merge_arrows_9df07b.png\" width=\"50\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p>It has been suggested that this article be merged with <i><a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a></i>. (discuss)</p></div>\n<div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Vampire Hunter Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Vampire Lord Quest, Storkus Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(100+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>If you encounter one of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lords\">Vampire Lords</a> and slay it, it will drop proof of its death. <a href=\"#/wiki/Storkus\">Storkus</a> might be interested.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nargor\">Nargor</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lords\">Vampire Lords</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>186,000 Experience Points, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Doll\">Vampire Doll</a>, the ability to obtain the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Skull\">Blood Skull</a> in the basement of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth%2FCastle\">Vengoth Castle</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Razing%21\">Razing!</a> achievement, and part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Castlemania\">Castlemania</a> achievement.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Completed missions 1-3 from <a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a>;</li>\n<li>100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lord%20Token\">Vampire Lord Tokens</a>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<ul><li>You need to give <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lord%20Token\">Vampire Lord Tokens</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Storkus\">Storkus</a> in order to advance in rank. All tokens required to advance to a higher rank need to be given at once.</li>\n<li>You don't have to slay the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lords\">Vampire Lords</a> yourself to get their tokens, so you can also just buy them from other players.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ranks_and_Rewards\">Ranks and Rewards</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Amount to be Given at Once</th>\n<th>Total Tokens Given</th>\n<th>Rank</th>\n<th>Reward\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1</b><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lord%20Token\"><img alt=\"Vampire Lord Token\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vampire_Lord_Token_dec0aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Fluke</td>\n<td>1,000 Experience Points\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>4</b><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lord%20Token\"><img alt=\"Vampire Lord Token\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vampire_Lord_Token_dec0aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Lucky</td>\n<td>5,000 Experience Points\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>5</b><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lord%20Token\"><img alt=\"Vampire Lord Token\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vampire_Lord_Token_dec0aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Determined</td>\n<td>10,000 Experience Points\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>10</b><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lord%20Token\"><img alt=\"Vampire Lord Token\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vampire_Lord_Token_dec0aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>Painstaking</td>\n<td>20,000 Experience Points\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>30</b><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lord%20Token\"><img alt=\"Vampire Lord Token\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vampire_Lord_Token_dec0aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>Obliterative</td>\n<td>50,000 Experience Points\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>50</b><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lord%20Token\"><img alt=\"Vampire Lord Token\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vampire_Lord_Token_dec0aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>Razing</td>\n<td>100,000 Experience Points, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Doll\">Vampire Doll</a>, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Razing%21\">Razing!</a> achievement, and the ability to obtain the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Skull\">Blood Skull</a> in the basement of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth%2FCastle\">Vengoth Castle</a>. Completing this quest is also part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Castlemania\">Castlemania</a> achievement.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a></p></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Fluke\">Fluke</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;ba